Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:06.17,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}Grok Bot lets you build a team of AI coworkers.\NEach one gets a name and a job.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.52,0:00:06.17,EN,,0,0,0,,Grok Bot lets you build a team of AI coworkers.\NEach one gets a name and a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:09.76,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}A researcher. A writer. One that handles your money.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.19,0:00:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,A researcher. A writer. One that handles your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:13.91,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}They work on a cloud computer,\Neven while your laptop is closed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.78,0:00:13.91,EN,,0,0,0,,They work on a cloud computer,\Neven while your laptop is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.40,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}Here's the part most people miss.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.93,0:00:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Here's the part most people miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:21.19,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}They all share that one computer.\NSame files. Same browser logins.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.42,0:00:21.19,EN,,0,0,0,,They all share that one computer.\NSame files. Same browser logins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.21,0:00:27.56,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}xAI's own docs say the screens are\N{\fs58}"separate work surfaces, not separate security boundaries."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.21,0:00:27.56,EN,,0,0,0,,xAI's own docs say the screens are\N{\fs58}"separate work surfaces, not separate security boundaries."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:33.10,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}So if you sign in to your bank for the finance bot,\Nevery other bot can use that login too.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.58,0:00:33.10,EN,,0,0,0,,So if you sign in to your bank for the finance bot,\Nevery other bot can use that login too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:37.77,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}Telling a bot "don't open finance" guides it.\NIt doesn't stop it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.12,0:00:37.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Telling a bot "don't open finance" guides it.\NIt doesn't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.24,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}So three rules.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So three rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:42.93,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}Only put things on that computer\Nthat every bot may use.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.26,0:00:42.93,EN,,0,0,0,,Only put things on that computer\Nthat every bot may use.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.95,0:00:46.89,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}If a bot needs a different level of trust,\Ngive it a separate account.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.95,0:00:46.89,EN,,0,0,0,,If a bot needs a different level of trust,\Ngive it a separate account.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.91,0:00:51.81,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}And never paste a password into chat.\NTake control and sign in yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.91,0:00:51.81,EN,,0,0,0,,And never paste a password into chat.\NTake control and sign in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:55.68,HALO,,0,0,0,,{\blur12}A name on the door is not a lock.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.83,0:00:55.68,EN,,0,0,0,,A name on the door is not a lock.
